concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Compliance with this Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A carrier must comply with this Act.  (2) In this clause: this Act includes the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999 and regulations under that Act and Chapter 5 of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979.  Schedule 1  Standard carrier licence conditions" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A carrier must comply with this Act.  (2) In this clause: this Act includes the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999 and regulations under that Act and Chapter 5 of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979.  Schedule 1  Standard carrier licence conditions"@en ;
