concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-19 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19 Ministerial pricing determinations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-19 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination setting out principles dealing with price-related terms and conditions relating to the obligations imposed by subclause 17(1). The determination is to be known as a Ministerial pricing determination.  (3) In this clause: price-related terms and conditions means terms and conditions relating to price or a method of ascertaining price.  Standard carrier licence conditions  Schedule 1 Access to network information  Part 4  Clause 20  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination setting out principles dealing with price-related terms and conditions relating to the obligations imposed by subclause 17(1). The determination is to be known as a Ministerial pricing determination.  (3) In this clause: price-related terms and conditions means terms and conditions relating to price or a method of ascertaining price.  Standard carrier licence conditions  Schedule 1 Access to network information  Part 4  Clause 20  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "26d76c22232223a99f0f0ca62101d866c44b53521ce980ccdcc9d93a6e134ef7" ;
