    skos:prefLabel "20 Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-20 ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • Carriers must provide other carriers with access to certain information relating to the operation of telecommunications networks." ;
