concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-21-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "21(2) Access to network information"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-21-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The first carrier must, if requested to do so by the second carrier, provide the second carrier with reasonable access to:  (a) timely and detailed information from the first carrier’s operations support systems; and  (b) timely and detailed traffic flow information." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The first carrier must, if requested to do so by the second carrier, provide the second carrier with reasonable access to:  (a) timely and detailed information from the first carrier’s operations support systems; and  (b) timely and detailed traffic flow information."@en ;
