concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-28 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28 Ministerial pricing determinations"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-28 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination setting out principles dealing with price-related terms and  Standard carrier licence conditions  Schedule 1 Access to network information  Part 4  Clause 29  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  conditions relating to an obligation imposed by clause 21, 22, 23, 24 or 25. The determination is to be known as a Ministerial pricing determination.  (3) In this clause: price-related terms and conditions means terms and conditions relating to price or a method of ascertaining price." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination setting out principles dealing with price-related terms and  Standard carrier licence conditions  Schedule 1 Access to network information  Part 4  Clause 29  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  conditions relating to an obligation imposed by clause 21, 22, 23, 24 or 25. The determination is to be known as a Ministerial pricing determination.  (3) In this clause: price-related terms and conditions means terms and conditions relating to price or a method of ascertaining price."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a038a5c173208d4000e8851f6c076e1a938132776eb9b7aabd7ab41a6e459408" ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-28-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-28-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.24" .
