concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-33-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33(5) Access to telecommunications transmission towers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-33-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the ACCC receives a request to make a decision about the issue of a certificate under subclause (3), the ACCC must use its best endeavours to make that decision within 10 business days after the request was made." ;
