    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-33-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) If, at the time the request was made:  (a) one or more provisions (the contingent provisions) of a contract have not come into force because:  Schedule 1  Standard carrier licence conditions" ;
