doc:sch-1-sec-36-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "36(4) Terms and conditions of access" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) The regulations may make provision for and in relation to the conduct of an arbitration under this clause.  Standard carrier licence conditions  Schedule 1 Access to telecommunications transmission towers and to underground facilities  Part 5  Clause 37  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-36-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36(5) Terms and conditions of access"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-36-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular arbitration conducted by the ACCC under this clause, the ACCC may be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of members, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or those members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson of the ACCC." ;
    skos:definition "(5) The regulations may provide that, for the purposes of a particular arbitration conducted by the ACCC under this clause, the ACCC may be constituted by a single member, or a specified number of members, of the ACCC. For each such arbitration, that member or those members are to be nominated in writing by the Chairperson of the ACCC."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e40330cfd6d296cb46cedd4e4bd7083ab35169aa587533068db35b5ab99c0dc7" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-36 ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "ACCC may be constituted by a single member or specified number of members for a particular arbitration." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.36" ;
