concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-36-ss-7 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36(7) Terms and conditions of access"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-36-ss-7 ;
    values:originalText "(7) An arbitrator must not make a determination under this clause if the determination would have the effect of:  (aa) preventing a designated Telstra successor company from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577A; or  (a) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577C or 577E; or  (b) if a final migration plan is in force—requiring a designated Telstra successor company to engage in conduct in connection with matters covered by the final migration plan." ;
    skos:definition "(7) An arbitrator must not make a determination under this clause if the determination would have the effect of:  (aa) preventing a designated Telstra successor company from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577A; or  (a) preventing Telstra from complying with an undertaking in force under section 577C or 577E; or  (b) if a final migration plan is in force—requiring a designated Telstra successor company to engage in conduct in connection with matters covered by the final migration plan."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "434d5f31a2b30e55826f772e1a1cd1c3f418e5369241326fccd95c12b59ba9e8" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-36 ;
    cof:pageNumber "36"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prevent arbitrators from making determinations that would prevent Telstra successors from complying with undertakings." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.36" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-36-ss-7-norm .
