concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-40 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40 Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-40 ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • Carriers must keep records about their designated overhead lines, telecommunications transmission towers and underground facilities. • Carriers must inspect their facilities regularly. • Carriers must investigate their facilities if there are reasonable grounds to suspect that the facilities are likely to endanger:  (a) the health or safety of persons; or  (b) property. • Carriers must take any remedial action that is reasonably required following such an inspection or investigation." ;
    skos:definition "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • Carriers must keep records about their designated overhead lines, telecommunications transmission towers and underground facilities. • Carriers must inspect their facilities regularly. • Carriers must investigate their facilities if there are reasonable grounds to suspect that the facilities are likely to endanger:  (a) the health or safety of persons; or  (b) property. • Carriers must take any remedial action that is reasonably required following such an inspection or investigation."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5cbed8f947ecb284cefc3a70dcda8b80ad07e20af8a2cae4244a4b797d899acd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "39"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Carriers must keep records, inspect facilities regularly, investigate and take remedial action." ;
    dc:description "Records, inspection reports, investigation findings" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.39" ;
