concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-45 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45 Definitions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-45 ;
    values:originalText "In this Part: active declared service means:  (a) an active declared service within the meaning of section 152AR of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (b) a declared service (within the meaning of subsection 152AL(8A) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010) that an NBN corporation supplies (whether to itself or to other persons); or  (c) a declared service within the meaning of subsection 152AL(8D) or (8E) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010. Note: Subsections 152AL(8A), (8D) and (8E) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deal with services supplied by an NBN corporation. designated interconnection service has the meaning given by clause 47. eligible service has the same meaning as in section 152AL of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010.  Standard carrier licence conditions  Schedule 1 Any-to-any connectivity  Part 7  Clause 46  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "In this Part: active declared service means:  (a) an active declared service within the meaning of section 152AR of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010; or  (b) a declared service (within the meaning of subsection 152AL(8A) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010) that an NBN corporation supplies (whether to itself or to other persons); or  (c) a declared service within the meaning of subsection 152AL(8D) or (8E) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010. Note: Subsections 152AL(8A), (8D) and (8E) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 deal with services supplied by an NBN corporation. designated interconnection service has the meaning given by clause 47. eligible service has the same meaning as in section 152AL of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010.  Standard carrier licence conditions  Schedule 1 Any-to-any connectivity  Part 7  Clause 46  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a8d6a247832bb905882e65b66a1c5bdadab68c8e7eabf29dfd481f19da753803" ;
    cof:pageNumber "42"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Defines terms for active declared service, designated interconnection service, and eligible service." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.42" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-45-norm .
