concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-73-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "73(3) Contents of draft or final functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-73-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If a final functional separation undertaking provides for the ACCC to perform functions or exercise powers in relation to the undertaking, the ACCC may perform those functions, and exercise those powers, in accordance with the undertaking.  Schedule 1  Standard carrier licence conditions" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If a final functional separation undertaking provides for the ACCC to perform functions or exercise powers in relation to the undertaking, the ACCC may perform those functions, and exercise those powers, in accordance with the undertaking.  Schedule 1  Standard carrier licence conditions"@en ;
