concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-80-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80(4) Variation of final functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Before varying a final functional separation undertaking, the Minister must:  (a) cause to be published on the Department’s website a notice:  (i) setting out the proposed variation; and  (ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the Minister about the proposed variation within 14 days after the notice is published; and  (b) give the ACCC a copy of the notice; and  (c) cause to be published on the Department’s website a copy of each submission received within the 14-day period mentioned in paragraph (a); and  (d) consider any submissions received within the 14-day period mentioned in paragraph (a); and  (e) ask the ACCC to give advice to the Minister, within 44 days after the notice is published, about the proposed variation; and  (f) have regard to any advice given by the ACCC.  Standard carrier licence conditions  Schedule 1 Functional separation of Telstra  Part 9 Functional separation undertaking  Division 2  Clause 80  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Minor variation" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Before varying a final functional separation undertaking, the Minister must:  (a) cause to be published on the Department’s website a notice:  (i) setting out the proposed variation; and  (ii) inviting persons to make submissions to the Minister about the proposed variation within 14 days after the notice is published; and  (b) give the ACCC a copy of the notice; and  (c) cause to be published on the Department’s website a copy of each submission received within the 14-day period mentioned in paragraph (a); and  (d) consider any submissions received within the 14-day period mentioned in paragraph (a); and  (e) ask the ACCC to give advice to the Minister, within 44 days after the notice is published, about the proposed variation; and  (f) have regard to any advice given by the ACCC.  Standard carrier licence conditions  Schedule 1 Functional separation of Telstra  Part 9 Functional separation undertaking  Division 2  Clause 80  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Minor variation"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ec42dadd413cff9a5f18484eaae6dbc837fb53fb934cc2f6c4ab8af220e676a3" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-80 ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Publish notice and invite submissions before varying final functional separation undertaking." ;
    dc:description "Notice, submissions, advice from ACCC" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
