concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-80-ss-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80(8) Variation of final functional separation undertaking"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-80-ss-8 ;
    values:originalText "(8) As soon as practicable after varying a final functional separation undertaking, the Minister must notify Telstra in writing of the variation. When variation comes into force" ;
