concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-1-sec-84-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "84(3) Control by Telstra of certain spectrum licences"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-84-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) This subclause covers a section 577A undertaking if:  Standard carrier licence conditions  Schedule 1 Control and use by Telstra of certain spectrum licences  Part 10 Control and use by Telstra of certain spectrum licences  Division 2  Clause 85  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) the following conditions are satisfied:  (i) the undertaking requires Telstra to give the ACCC a draft migration plan;  (ii) in accordance with the undertaking, Telstra has given the ACCC a draft migration plan;  (iii) the ACCC has approved the draft migration plan under section 577BD, 577BDA, 577BDB or 577BDC; or  (b) the undertaking does not require Telstra to give the ACCC a draft migration plan." ;
    skos:definition "(3) This subclause covers a section 577A undertaking if:  Standard carrier licence conditions  Schedule 1 Control and use by Telstra of certain spectrum licences  Part 10 Control and use by Telstra of certain spectrum licences  Division 2  Clause 85  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (a) the following conditions are satisfied:  (i) the undertaking requires Telstra to give the ACCC a draft migration plan;  (ii) in accordance with the undertaking, Telstra has given the ACCC a draft migration plan;  (iii) the ACCC has approved the draft migration plan under section 577BD, 577BDA, 577BDB or 577BDC; or  (b) the undertaking does not require Telstra to give the ACCC a draft migration plan."@en ;
