doc:sch-2-sec-1-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "1(2) Compliance with this Act" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) In this clause: this Act includes the Telecommunications (Consumer Protection and Service Standards) Act 1999 and regulations under that Act and Chapter 5 of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979.  Standard service provider rules  Schedule 2 Operator services  Part 2  Clause 2  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "72"^^xsd:integer .

