concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-2-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • If a person or association is under an obligation to provide and maintain an integrated public number database, carriage service providers must give the person or association information in connection with the fulfilment of that obligation." ;
    skos:definition "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • If a person or association is under an obligation to provide and maintain an integrated public number database, carriage service providers must give the person or association information in connection with the fulfilment of that obligation."@en ;
