concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-2-sec-11-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11(3) Carriage service providers must give information to another"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-11-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) In this clause: number has the same meaning as in Division 2 of Part 22. public number means a number specified for use in connection with the supply of carriage services to the public in Australia (within the meaning of subsection 456(2)).  Standard service provider rules  Schedule 2 Itemised billing  Part 5  Clause 12  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(3) In this clause: number has the same meaning as in Division 2 of Part 22. public number means a number specified for use in connection with the supply of carriage services to the public in Australia (within the meaning of subsection 456(2)).  Standard service provider rules  Schedule 2 Itemised billing  Part 5  Clause 12  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ae032e2e670d053232fbc8b8bcda645942c5d0518b4badc08c83dc886d6b5dcd" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-2-sec-11 ;
