doc:sch-2-sec-13-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "13(5) Itemised billing" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) For the purposes of the application of this clause to a carriage service provider who supplies a standard telephone service to a customer, a designated local call is a call that:  (a) is made using that service; and  (b) is made between points in the applicable zone in relation to the provider and in relation to the customer; and  (c) is not an exempt call (as defined by subclause (6)).  Schedule 2  Standard service provider rules" ;
