concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-2-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 Details that are not to be specified in an itemised bill"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACMA may, by written instrument, determine that specified details must not be shown in an itemised bill provided by a carriage service provider to a customer.  (2) In making a determination under subclause (1), the ACMA must have regard to the Australian Privacy Principles. This subclause does not, by implication, limit the matters to which the ACMA is to have regard.  (3) A carriage service provider must comply with a determination under subclause (1).  Schedule 2  Standard service provider rules" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The ACMA may, by written instrument, determine that specified details must not be shown in an itemised bill provided by a carriage service provider to a customer.  (2) In making a determination under subclause (1), the ACMA must have regard to the Australian Privacy Principles. This subclause does not, by implication, limit the matters to which the ACMA is to have regard.  (3) A carriage service provider must comply with a determination under subclause (1).  Schedule 2  Standard service provider rules"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "255d10f6e6980171328b3db1c96d13a5a81db3a6194996d08b0656e84a97cc50" ;
    cof:pageNumber "81"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-2-sec-15-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-2-sec-15-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-2-sec-15-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
