concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3-sec-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "1 Simplified outline"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-1 ;
    values:originalText "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • A carrier may enter on land and exercise any of the following powers:  (a) the power to inspect the land to determine whether the land is suitable for the carrier’s purposes;  (b) the power to install a facility on the land;  (c) the power to maintain a facility that is situated on the land. • The power to install a facility may only be exercised if:  (a) the carrier holds a facility installation permit; or  (b) the facility is a low-impact facility; or  (c) the facility is a temporary facility for use by, or on behalf of, a defence organisation for defence purposes; or  (d) the installation is carried out before 1 July 2000 for the sole purpose of connecting a building to a network that was in existence on 30 June 1997. • A facility installation permit will only be issued in relation to a facility if:  Schedule 3  Carriers’ powers and immunities" ;
    skos:definition "The following is a simplified outline of this Part: • A carrier may enter on land and exercise any of the following powers:  (a) the power to inspect the land to determine whether the land is suitable for the carrier’s purposes;  (b) the power to install a facility on the land;  (c) the power to maintain a facility that is situated on the land. • The power to install a facility may only be exercised if:  (a) the carrier holds a facility installation permit; or  (b) the facility is a low-impact facility; or  (c) the facility is a temporary facility for use by, or on behalf of, a defence organisation for defence purposes; or  (d) the installation is carried out before 1 July 2000 for the sole purpose of connecting a building to a network that was in existence on 30 June 1997. • A facility installation permit will only be issued in relation to a facility if:  Schedule 3  Carriers’ powers and immunities"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "2db9c42e94a7360fa28225eecf7c0877e2e967a554763a380c6505b019360060" ;
    cof:pageNumber "85"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Carrier may enter land and exercise certain powers." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.85" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3-sec-1-norm .
