    values:originalText "(5) If:  (a) a carrier installs a low-impact facility under Division 3; and  (b) the installation is covered by paragraph 6(5)(g); the carrier must remove the facility within 28 days after the facility ceases to be needed to provide capacity to supply carriage services to one or more emergency services organisations (within the meaning of that paragraph) so that those organisations can deal with an emergency or natural disaster." ;
