doc:sch-3-sec-9a-ss-4 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "9A(4) Carrier to restore land—removal of temporary facilities" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(4) If the installation of the facility is covered by subclause 7(3A), the carrier must take all reasonable steps to ensure that the restoration begins within 10 business days after the removal of the facility." ;
