    skos:prefLabel "17(6) Notice to owner of land—general"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-17-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) Subclause (1) does not apply if:  (a) the carrier intends to engage in activities under Division 2 (which deals with inspection of land), 3 (which deals with installation of facilities) or 4 (which deals with maintenance); and  (b) those activities need to be carried out without delay in order to protect:  (i) the integrity of a telecommunications network or a facility; or  (ii) the health or safety of persons; or  (iii) the environment; or  (iv) property; or  (v) the maintenance of an adequate level of service." ;
    skos:definition "(6) Subclause (1) does not apply if:  (a) the carrier intends to engage in activities under Division 2 (which deals with inspection of land), 3 (which deals with installation of facilities) or 4 (which deals with maintenance); and  (b) those activities need to be carried out without delay in order to protect:  (i) the integrity of a telecommunications network or a facility; or  (ii) the health or safety of persons; or  (iii) the environment; or  (iv) property; or  (v) the maintenance of an adequate level of service."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5acc17b5e6269e8bc5ab8fe84bcbc376f99ac3d7db2328a2b332ad82cb77262e" ;
