concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3-sec-17-ss-6a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17(6A) Notice to owner of land—general"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-17-ss-6a ;
    values:originalText "(6A) Subclause (1) does not apply if:  (a) the carrier intends to engage in an activity under Division 2, 3 or 4 in relation to the installation, proposed installation or maintenance of a temporary defence facility; and  (b) the carrier considers that compliance with subclause (1) is impracticable in the circumstances." ;
