concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3-sec-28 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28 Special provisions relating to environmental matters"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-28 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Chapters 2 and 4 and Divisions 1 to 4 (inclusive) of Part 13 of the Environment Protection and Biodiversity Conservation Act 1999 do not apply to:  (a) the performance of a function, or the exercise of a power, conferred on the ACMA by this Division; or  Carriers’ powers and immunities  Schedule 3 General provisions  Part 1 Facility installation permits  Division 6  Clause 29  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) an action (as defined in that Act) authorised by a facility installation permit.  (2) Before issuing a facility installation permit, the ACMA must consult the Environment Secretary.  (5) In this clause: this Division includes:  (a) Part 25, to the extent that that Part relates to the holding of a public inquiry in relation to a permit; and  (b) Part 29, to the extent that that Part relates to this Division." ;
    skos:definition "(1) Chapters 2 and 4 and Divisions 1 to 4 (inclusive) of Part 13 of the Environment Protection and Biodiversity Conservation Act 1999 do not apply to:  (a) the performance of a function, or the exercise of a power, conferred on the ACMA by this Division; or  Carriers’ powers and immunities  Schedule 3 General provisions  Part 1 Facility installation permits  Division 6  Clause 29  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) an action (as defined in that Act) authorised by a facility installation permit.  (2) Before issuing a facility installation permit, the ACMA must consult the Environment Secretary.  (5) In this clause: this Division includes:  (a) Part 25, to the extent that that Part relates to the holding of a public inquiry in relation to a permit; and  (b) Part 29, to the extent that that Part relates to this Division."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "06b1b823469687c9a9ce1c6bc7dc4efab4c332e33917e9ab1a689e47ca087ec3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "122"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3-sec-28-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3-sec-28-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3-sec-28-ss-5 ;
