concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3-sec-36 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36 Activities not generally exempt from State and Territory laws"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-36 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Divisions 2, 3 and 4 do not operate so as to authorise an activity to the extent that the carrying out of the activity would be inconsistent with the provisions of a law of a State or Territory.  (2) The rule set out in subclause (1) has effect subject to any exemptions that are applicable under clause 37." ;
