concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3-sec-41 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "41 Guidelines"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-41 ;
    values:originalText "(1) In performing a function, or exercising a power, conferred on the ACMA by this Part, the ACMA must have regard to:  (a) any guidelines in force under subclause (2); and  (b) such other matters as the ACMA considers relevant.  (2) The ACMA may, by written instrument, formulate guidelines for the purposes of subclause (1)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) In performing a function, or exercising a power, conferred on the ACMA by this Part, the ACMA must have regard to:  (a) any guidelines in force under subclause (2); and  (b) such other matters as the ACMA considers relevant.  (2) The ACMA may, by written instrument, formulate guidelines for the purposes of subclause (1)."@en ;
