concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3-sec-60 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "60 Existing buildings, structures and facilities—application of State"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-60 ;
    values:originalText "and Territory laws  A law of a State or Territory that relates to:  (a) the standards applicable to:  (i) the design; or  (ii) the manner of the construction;  of a building, structure or facility; or  (b) the approval of the construction of a building, structure or facility; or  (c) the occupancy, or use, of a building, structure or facility; or  (d) the alteration or demolition of a building, structure or facility; does not apply to a building, structure or facility that is owned or operated by a carrier to the extent that the construction, alteration or demolition of the building, structure or facility was or is authorised by:  (e) section 116 of the Telecommunications Act 1991; or  (f) Division 3 of Part 7 of the Telecommunications Act 1991; or  (g) a repealed law of the Commonwealth." ;
    skos:definition "and Territory laws  A law of a State or Territory that relates to:  (a) the standards applicable to:  (i) the design; or  (ii) the manner of the construction;  of a building, structure or facility; or  (b) the approval of the construction of a building, structure or facility; or  (c) the occupancy, or use, of a building, structure or facility; or  (d) the alteration or demolition of a building, structure or facility; does not apply to a building, structure or facility that is owned or operated by a carrier to the extent that the construction, alteration or demolition of the building, structure or facility was or is authorised by:  (e) section 116 of the Telecommunications Act 1991; or  (f) Division 3 of Part 7 of the Telecommunications Act 1991; or  (g) a repealed law of the Commonwealth."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ca9dfa2643afa8588d6137fa5711fe4b5f2227574b5c51cca346eab93b7ec29c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "139"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application of State laws to certain building and facility standards" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.139" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3-sec-60-norm .
