doc:sch-3-sec-62-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "62(2) Compensation for acquisition of property" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) In assessing compensation payable under this clause arising out of an event, the following must be taken into account:  (a) any compensation obtained by the person as a result of an agreement between the person and the carrier otherwise than under this clause but arising out of the same event;  (b) any damages or compensation recovered by the person from the carrier, or other remedy given, in a proceeding begun otherwise than under this clause but arising out of the same event." ;
    cof:pageNumber "140"^^xsd:integer .

