concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Response to a request to declare a protection zone"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "ACMA decides to develop a proposal  (1) If:  (a) a person requests the ACMA to declare a protection zone; and  Protection of submarine cables  Schedule 3A Protection zones  Part 2 Declaration of protection zones  Division 2  Clause 7  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) the ACMA decides to develop a proposal for a protection zone in response to the request; the ACMA must give the person a copy of its proposal. ACMA decides not to develop a proposal  (2) If:  (a) a person requests the ACMA to declare a protection zone; and  (b) the ACMA decides not to develop a proposal for a protection zone in response to the request; the ACMA must notify the person in writing of the ACMA’s decision and the reasons for the decision." ;
    skos:definition "ACMA decides to develop a proposal  (1) If:  (a) a person requests the ACMA to declare a protection zone; and  Protection of submarine cables  Schedule 3A Protection zones  Part 2 Declaration of protection zones  Division 2  Clause 7  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (b) the ACMA decides to develop a proposal for a protection zone in response to the request; the ACMA must give the person a copy of its proposal. ACMA decides not to develop a proposal  (2) If:  (a) a person requests the ACMA to declare a protection zone; and  (b) the ACMA decides not to develop a proposal for a protection zone in response to the request; the ACMA must notify the person in writing of the ACMA’s decision and the reasons for the decision."@en ;
