concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-14 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14 Duration of declaration"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-14 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A declaration of a protection zone continues in effect until the ACMA revokes it.  (2) To avoid doubt, a declaration continues in effect even if the submarine cable or cables in the protection zone have ceased to operate.  Protection of submarine cables  Schedule 3A Protection zones  Part 2 Declaration of protection zones  Division 2  Clause 15  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Subdivision B—Prerequisites to declaration of a protection zone" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A declaration of a protection zone continues in effect until the ACMA revokes it.  (2) To avoid doubt, a declaration continues in effect even if the submarine cable or cables in the protection zone have ceased to operate.  Protection of submarine cables  Schedule 3A Protection zones  Part 2 Declaration of protection zones  Division 2  Clause 15  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Subdivision B—Prerequisites to declaration of a protection zone"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5522767371934fb62e4befbd1d5abcfd83c97fa3bc548ac313084f342738c9c2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "156"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-14-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-14-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.156" .
doc:sch-3a-sec-14 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "14 Duration of declaration" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A declaration of a protection zone continues in effect until the ACMA revokes it.  (2) To avoid doubt, a declaration continues in effect even if the submarine cable or cables in the protection zone have ceased to operate.  Protection of submarine cables  Schedule 3A Protection zones  Part 2 Declaration of protection zones  Division 2  Clause 15  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  Subdivision B—Prerequisites to declaration of a protection zone" ;
    cof:pageNumber "156"^^xsd:integer .

