concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-17a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17A ACMA to publish summary of proposal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-17a ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This clause applies to a proposal developed under clause 15. Publication  (2) The ACMA must:  (a) prepare a summary of the proposal; and  (b) publish the summary:  (i) in the Gazette; and  (ii) on the ACMA’s website; and  (iii) in a newspaper circulating generally in each State, the Australian Capital Territory and the Northern Territory; and  (iv) if an external Territory is affected by the proposal—in a newspaper circulating generally in the external Territory.  Protection of submarine cables  Schedule 3A Protection zones  Part 2 Declaration of protection zones  Division 2  Clause 18  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (3) The summary of the proposal must include information about how people can:  (a) access the proposal on the ACMA’s website; and  (b) request a copy of the proposal under subclause 17(3)." ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This clause applies to a proposal developed under clause 15. Publication  (2) The ACMA must:  (a) prepare a summary of the proposal; and  (b) publish the summary:  (i) in the Gazette; and  (ii) on the ACMA’s website; and  (iii) in a newspaper circulating generally in each State, the Australian Capital Territory and the Northern Territory; and  (iv) if an external Territory is affected by the proposal—in a newspaper circulating generally in the external Territory.  Protection of submarine cables  Schedule 3A Protection zones  Part 2 Declaration of protection zones  Division 2  Clause 18  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (3) The summary of the proposal must include information about how people can:  (a) access the proposal on the ACMA’s website; and  (b) request a copy of the proposal under subclause 17(3)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000" ;
    cof:pageNumber "158"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-17a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-17a-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-17a-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-act-1997.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-act-1997.pdf, p.158" .
doc:sch-3a-sec-17a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "17A ACMA to publish summary of proposal" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This clause applies to a proposal developed under clause 15. Publication  (2) The ACMA must:  (a) prepare a summary of the proposal; and  (b) publish the summary:  (i) in the Gazette; and  (ii) on the ACMA’s website; and  (iii) in a newspaper circulating generally in each State, the Australian Capital Territory and the Northern Territory; and  (iv) if an external Territory is affected by the proposal—in a newspaper circulating generally in the external Territory.  Protection of submarine cables  Schedule 3A Protection zones  Part 2 Declaration of protection zones  Division 2  Clause 18  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (3) The summary of the proposal must include information about how people can:  (a) access the proposal on the ACMA’s website; and  (b) request a copy of the proposal under subclause 17(3)." ;
    cof:pageNumber "158"^^xsd:integer .

