concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-17a-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "17A(3) ACMA to publish summary of proposal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-17a-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The summary of the proposal must include information about how people can:  (a) access the proposal on the ACMA’s website; and  (b) request a copy of the proposal under subclause 17(3)." ;
