    values:originalText "In deciding whether to declare a protection zone in relation to one or more submarine cables, the ACMA must have regard to:  (b) any submissions received from the public about the proposal for the protection zone; and  (c) the objective of facilitating the supply of efficient, modern and cost-effective carriage services to the public; and  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables" ;
    skos:definition "In deciding whether to declare a protection zone in relation to one or more submarine cables, the ACMA must have regard to:  (b) any submissions received from the public about the proposal for the protection zone; and  (c) the objective of facilitating the supply of efficient, modern and cost-effective carriage services to the public; and  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4f8983c58ff9ca565b7064bbc164781e2dcbf80de7075fb15eb00f2f18cfa45f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "159"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Consider public submissions and objective of facilitating efficient carriage services when deciding to declare a protection zone." ;
