doc:sch-3a-sec-24 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "24 Variation or revocation on ACMA’s initiative or in response to" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "request  A variation or revocation of a declaration of a protection zone may be made:  (a) on the ACMA’s own initiative; or  (b) at the request of a person." ;
    cof:pageNumber "162"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-25 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25 ACMA to notify affected carrier of request to vary or revoke a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-25 ;
    values:originalText "declaration  If a person requests the ACMA to vary or revoke a declaration of a protection zone, the ACMA must, as soon as practicable, give details of the request to each carrier who is responsible for a submarine cable or cables in the protection zone.  Protection of submarine cables  Schedule 3A Protection zones  Part 2 Varying or revoking a declaration of a protection zone  Division 3  Clause 26  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026" ;
    skos:definition "declaration  If a person requests the ACMA to vary or revoke a declaration of a protection zone, the ACMA must, as soon as practicable, give details of the request to each carrier who is responsible for a submarine cable or cables in the protection zone.  Protection of submarine cables  Schedule 3A Protection zones  Part 2 Varying or revoking a declaration of a protection zone  Division 3  Clause 26  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026"@en ;
