doc:sch-3a-sec-26-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26(1) Response to a request to vary or revoke a declaration" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) If:  (a) a person requests the ACMA to vary or revoke a declaration of a protection zone; and  (b) the ACMA decides to develop a variation or revocation proposal in response to the request; the ACMA must:  (c) give the person a copy of its proposal; and  (d) if the proposal differs from what the person requested— notify the person in writing of the reasons for the difference. ACMA decides not to develop a variation or revocation proposal" ;
