    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-26-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If:  (a) a person requests the ACMA to vary or revoke a declaration of a protection zone; and  (b) the ACMA decides not to develop a proposal to vary or revoke a declaration of a protection zone in response to the request; the ACMA must notify the person in writing of the ACMA’s decision and the reasons for the decision. 27  Decision not to vary or revoke a declaration after a request to do so  If, after developing a proposal to vary or revoke a declaration of a protection zone in response to a request by a person, the ACMA:  (a) decides not to vary or revoke the declaration; or  (b) decides to vary the declaration in a way different from that requested; or  (c) decides to vary the declaration when revocation was requested; or  (d) decides to revoke the declaration when variation was requested;  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables" ;
    skos:definition "(2) If:  (a) a person requests the ACMA to vary or revoke a declaration of a protection zone; and  (b) the ACMA decides not to develop a proposal to vary or revoke a declaration of a protection zone in response to the request; the ACMA must notify the person in writing of the ACMA’s decision and the reasons for the decision. 27  Decision not to vary or revoke a declaration after a request to do so  If, after developing a proposal to vary or revoke a declaration of a protection zone in response to a request by a person, the ACMA:  (a) decides not to vary or revoke the declaration; or  (b) decides to vary the declaration in a way different from that requested; or  (c) decides to vary the declaration when revocation was requested; or  (d) decides to revoke the declaration when variation was requested;  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables"@en ;
