concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-30-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30(4) ACMA to develop a variation or revocation proposal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-30-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) However, subclause (3) does not apply if the ACMA has:  (a) made the variation or revocation to which the proposal relates; or  (b) decided not to make the variation or revocation to which the proposal relates." ;
