concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-30-ss-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "30(5) ACMA to develop a variation or revocation proposal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-30-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) If the person requests that a copy of the proposal be given in electronic form, the ACMA may give the copy in electronic form." ;
    skos:definition "(5) If the person requests that a copy of the proposal be given in electronic form, the ACMA may give the copy in electronic form."@en ;
