concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-32a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32A ACMA to publish summary of proposal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-32a ;
    values:originalText "Scope  (1) This clause applies to a proposal developed under clause 30. Summary  (2) The ACMA must:  (a) prepare a summary of the proposal; and  (b) publish the summary:  (i) in the Gazette; and  (ii) on the ACMA’s website; and  (iii) in a newspaper circulating generally in each State, the Australian Capital Territory and the Northern Territory; and  (iv) if an external Territory is affected by the proposal—in a newspaper circulating generally in the external Territory.  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables" ;
    skos:definition "Scope  (1) This clause applies to a proposal developed under clause 30. Summary  (2) The ACMA must:  (a) prepare a summary of the proposal; and  (b) publish the summary:  (i) in the Gazette; and  (ii) on the ACMA’s website; and  (iii) in a newspaper circulating generally in each State, the Australian Capital Territory and the Northern Territory; and  (iv) if an external Territory is affected by the proposal—in a newspaper circulating generally in the external Territory.  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000" ;
