concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-35 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "35 Deadline for final decision about varying or revoking a protection"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-35 ;
    values:originalText "zone  If the ACMA publishes a proposal to vary or revoke a declaration of a protection zone under clause 32, the ACMA must decide whether to vary or revoke the declaration within 180 days after the day on which the proposal was published.  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables" ;
    skos:definition "zone  If the ACMA publishes a proposal to vary or revoke a declaration of a protection zone under clause 32, the ACMA must decide whether to vary or revoke the declaration within 180 days after the day on which the proposal was published.  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4e84e489f116c03ca95ec80e1abcb616be56d3a12da37572ca082546c9363b8b" ;
