concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-40 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "40 Engaging in prohibited or restricted activities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-40 ;
    values:originalText "A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person engages in conduct; and  (b) the conduct occurs in a protection zone; and  (c) the conduct:  (i) is prohibited in the protection zone; or  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables" ;
    skos:definition "A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person engages in conduct; and  (b) the conduct occurs in a protection zone; and  (c) the conduct:  (i) is prohibited in the protection zone; or  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables"@en ;
