doc:sch-3a-sec-52-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "52(1) Form of application etc." ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) An application must be:  (a) in writing; and  (b) in the form approved in writing by the ACMA." ;
    cof:pageNumber "179"^^xsd:integer .

concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-52-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "52(2) Form of application etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-52-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The approved form must require the application to set out:  (a) the proposed route or routes, in Australian waters, of the submarine cable or cables specified in the application; and  (b) information about the ownership and control of the submarine cable or cables specified in the application; and  (c) any other relevant information.  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The approved form must require the application to set out:  (a) the proposed route or routes, in Australian waters, of the submarine cable or cables specified in the application; and  (b) information about the ownership and control of the submarine cable or cables specified in the application; and  (c) any other relevant information.  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables"@en ;
