concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-57 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "57 Matters to which the ACMA must have regard in making a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-57 ;
    values:originalText "decision about a permit  In deciding whether to grant a protection zone installation permit, the ACMA must have regard to:  (a) if the Secretary of the Attorney-General’s Department or the Home Affairs Secretary makes a submission to the ACMA under clause 55A—that submission; and  (b) any other matters that the ACMA considers relevant." ;
    skos:definition "decision about a permit  In deciding whether to grant a protection zone installation permit, the ACMA must have regard to:  (a) if the Secretary of the Attorney-General’s Department or the Home Affairs Secretary makes a submission to the ACMA under clause 55A—that submission; and  (b) any other matters that the ACMA considers relevant."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1c68a3c48481c9df05e1d47aa4df695bbe600a99bf5c6ad6a8b2975083c31e14" ;
    cof:pageNumber "184"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "ACMA must consider certain matters when deciding on a permit" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
