    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-68 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The ACMA may request the applicant to give the ACMA, within the period specified in the request, further information about the application.  Protection of submarine cables  Schedule 3A Permits to install submarine cables  Part 3 Non-protection zone installation permits  Division 3  Clause 69  Telecommunications Act 1997  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  (2) The ACMA may refuse to consider the application until the applicant gives the ACMA the information." ;
