concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-70-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "70(3) Consultation"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-70-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Within 15 business days after the day on which a Secretary receives a copy of the application, that Secretary must:  (a) give a written notice to the ACMA stating that, while the notice remains in force, the ACMA must not grant the permit; or  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables" ;
    skos:definition "(3) Within 15 business days after the day on which a Secretary receives a copy of the application, that Secretary must:  (a) give a written notice to the ACMA stating that, while the notice remains in force, the ACMA must not grant the permit; or  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables"@en ;
