concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-78 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78 Application of this Division"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-78 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Division applies to the installation of an international submarine cable:  (a) in a protection zone; or  (b) in Australian waters, other than coastal waters of a State or Territory; by or on behalf of a carrier. Note: A Code of Practice made under subclause 15(1) of Schedule 3 may impose conditions in addition to the conditions imposed in this Division.  (2) This Division applies to the installation of a domestic submarine cable in a protection zone by, or on behalf of, a carrier. Note: A Code of Practice made under subclause 15(1) of Schedule 3 may impose conditions in addition to the conditions imposed in this Division." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This Division applies to the installation of an international submarine cable:  (a) in a protection zone; or  (b) in Australian waters, other than coastal waters of a State or Territory; by or on behalf of a carrier. Note: A Code of Practice made under subclause 15(1) of Schedule 3 may impose conditions in addition to the conditions imposed in this Division.  (2) This Division applies to the installation of a domestic submarine cable in a protection zone by, or on behalf of, a carrier. Note: A Code of Practice made under subclause 15(1) of Schedule 3 may impose conditions in addition to the conditions imposed in this Division."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b21605089a6868a75cffff16f216fae07a17b4e43cc374f29d4443074f99ab31" ;
    cof:pageNumber "201"^^xsd:integer ;
