concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-79 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "79 Installation to do as little damage as practicable"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-79 ;
    values:originalText "The carrier must ensure that all reasonable steps are taken to ensure that the installation causes as little detriment and inconvenience, and as little damage, as is practicable." ;
    skos:definition "The carrier must ensure that all reasonable steps are taken to ensure that the installation causes as little detriment and inconvenience, and as little damage, as is practicable."@en ;
