concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-80 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "80 Management of installation activities"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-80 ;
    values:originalText "The carrier must ensure that all reasonable steps are taken:  (a) to act in accordance with good engineering practice; and  (b) to protect the safety of persons and property; and  (c) to protect the environment.  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables" ;
    skos:definition "The carrier must ensure that all reasonable steps are taken:  (a) to act in accordance with good engineering practice; and  (b) to protect the safety of persons and property; and  (c) to protect the environment.  Schedule 3A  Protection of submarine cables"@en ;
