    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person installs, or causes to be installed, an international submarine cable; and  (b) the cable is installed:  (i) in Australian waters that are not in a protection zone and that are not coastal waters of a State or the Northern Territory; or  (ii) in a protection zone; and  (c) the person does not have a permit under this Part authorising the installation of the cable in the place in which it is installed. Penalty: 200 penalty units." ;
