concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-84-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "84(3) Installing an international submarine cable without a permit"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-84-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subclause (1) does not apply to a person who installs an international submarine cable on behalf of a carrier, if the carrier has a permit authorising the installation of the cable. Note: The defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matters in subclause (3). See subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subclause (1) does not apply to a person who installs an international submarine cable on behalf of a carrier, if the carrier has a permit authorising the installation of the cable. Note: The defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matters in subclause (3). See subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "91ee271472f84b889a53ad6f7b6793b1077915bdf90d867c39ed5bb9d5e4a166" ;
    values:partOf concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-84 ;
    cof:pageNumber "204"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Installation of international submarine cable without permit is permitted for carriers with a permit." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
