concept:telecommunications-act-1997-sch-3a-sec-89 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "89 Delegation by the Secretary of the Attorney-General’s"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3a-sec-89 ;
    values:originalText "Department  (1) The Secretary of the Attorney-General’s Department may, by writing, delegate any or all of his or her powers under this Schedule to an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the Attorney-General’s Department.  (2) A delegate must comply with any directions of the Secretary of the Attorney-General’s Department." ;
    skos:definition "Department  (1) The Secretary of the Attorney-General’s Department may, by writing, delegate any or all of his or her powers under this Schedule to an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the Attorney-General’s Department.  (2) A delegate must comply with any directions of the Secretary of the Attorney-General’s Department."@en ;
